      }
    },
    "To do this, NitiaDock watches for the four ways into full screen: the green window button, Control-Command-F, Control-Left or Right Arrow, and a three-finger swipe. It looks at clicks, key presses and gestures only to recognise these. What you type is never recorded, logged or sent anywhere. Turning this off stops the watching completely.": {
      "comment": "fork: NitiaDock",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To do this, NitiaDock watches for the four ways into full screen: the green window button, Control-Command-F, Control-Left or Right Arrow, and a three-finger swipe. It looks at clicks, key presses and gestures only to recognise these. What you type is never recorded, logged or sent anywhere. Turning this off stops the watching completely."
          }
        }
      }
    },
